Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S01  Downbeat, before the first line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:08.14,Shot,,0,0,0,,S02  "Hi, kids! Today we're learning how an opt-out works."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:11.57,Shot,,0,0,0,,S03  "Say hello to Little Switch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:18.16,Shot,,0,0,0,,S04  V01 "Hi! I've got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S05  "You typed a little question…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:25.24,Shot,,0,0,0,,S06  "And an answer hopped on top of it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:28.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,S07  V02 "That's neat, but what if I would rather read the page myself?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:32.58,Shot,,0,0,0,,S08  "Well, there's a tiny tab marked 'Web'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:36.11,Shot,,0,0,0,,S09  V03 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.62,Shot,,0,0,0,,S10  "You push me down for off…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:37.89,Shot,,0,0,0,,S11  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:39.85,Shot,,0,0,0,,S12  "…so how'd I just return?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:42.91,Shot,,0,0,0,,S13  "Default on! Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:46.45,Shot,,0,0,0,,S14  "It was there when you woke up…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:50.01,Shot,,0,0,0,,S15  "You can hide it, you can mute it…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.01,0:00:53.57,Shot,,0,0,0,,S16  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:56.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S17  "Default on!" / V04 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S18  Flute and scat fill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:08.38,Shot,,0,0,0,,S19  "Now, 'opt-in' means somebody asks you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:15.13,Shot,,0,0,0,,S20  V05 "And 'opt-out' means that no one asked you…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:20.61,Shot,,0,0,0,,S21  "And 'default' is the setting that they picked…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.23,Shot,,0,0,0,,S22  "…they'll say you picked the same."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:27.11,Shot,,0,0,0,,S23  "Got that? Opt-in, opt-out, default. There'll be a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.11,0:01:29.36,Shot,,0,0,0,,S24  V06 "There's always a test."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:33.46,Shot,,0,0,0,,S25  "Now your inbox has a helper…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:37.06,Shot,,0,0,0,,S26  "A lawsuit says it flipped itself last fall…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:38.30,Shot,,0,0,0,,S27  V07 "And what's the company say?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:44.15,Shot,,0,0,0,,S28  "That it's fine, and here's the door: / Just a menu, then a menu…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:47.63,Shot,,0,0,0,,S29  "Then the TV got an update in the middle of the night,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:51.03,Shot,,0,0,0,,S30  "And a brand-new tile was waiting…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:52.39,Shot,,0,0,0,,S31  V08 "Can I delete it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:53.63,Shot,,0,0,0,,S32  "You can hide it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:56.11,Shot,,0,0,0,,S33  V09 "Is that the same?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:58.80,Shot,,0,0,0,,S34  "…Next verse!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:03.84,Shot,,0,0,0,,S35  V10 "I've only got two sides…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.08,Shot,,0,0,0,,S36  [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:16.29,Shot,,0,0,0,,S37  Chorus 2, first three lines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:20.90,Shot,,0,0,0,,S38  "But the switch is just a picture…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.31,Shot,,0,0,0,,S39  V11 "(On, on, on…)"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.18,Shot,,0,0,0,,S40  "Pop quiz!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:30.74,Shot,,0,0,0,,S41  "There's a blue ring in the chat app…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:32.70,Shot,,0,0,0,,S42  V12 "I'll uninstall it!" / "Nope!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.82,Shot,,0,0,0,,S43  V13 "I'll mute it, then?" / "That's not so bad!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.90,Shot,,0,0,0,,S44  "Now your phone has got an update…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:42.06,Shot,,0,0,0,,S45  V14 "Where's the 'No'?" / "There isn't one!…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.52,Shot,,0,0,0,,S46  "In Australia, office software went up forty-five percent…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.99,Shot,,0,0,0,,S47  V15 "Was there one without the robot?" / "Only once you tried to leave!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:52.78,Shot,,0,0,0,,S48  "Now the school's the place for learning…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:56.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,S49  "So the school said, 'No AI, please'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:59.93,Shot,,0,0,0,,S50  "And the giant said, 'We hear you!'…"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:03.68,Shot,,0,0,0,,S51  "Take the robot with your search, or else there's no search there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.54,Shot,,0,0,0,,S52  [record scratch, tape rewind]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:12.82,Shot,,0,0,0,,S53  "Ahem! Correction, boys and girls!…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:15.22,Shot,,0,0,0,,S54  V16 "And the answer box on top?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.18,Shot,,0,0,0,,S55  "…That one's 'deeply integrated.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:20.38,Shot,,0,0,0,,S56  V17 "What's that mean?" / "It means it stays."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:37.49,Shot,,0,0,0,,S57  Final chorus, through the second-to-last line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:39.40,Shot,,0,0,0,,S58  Last "Default on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.84,Shot,,0,0,0,,S59  V18 "I've got two sides."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,S60  [click] [click] [click]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:46.00,Shot,,0,0,0,,S61  "…Guess one of 'em was just for show."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:51.94,Shot,,0,0,0,,S62  "And that's how an opt-out works! Join us next week…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:55.23,Shot,,0,0,0,,S63  [pop-up chime] / "Huh. Who asked for that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:58.88,Shot,,0,0,0,,S64  V19 "Hey, who wrote this song, anyway?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:01.34,Shot,,0,0,0,,S65  "An AI did."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:09.17,Shot,,0,0,0,,S66  "…But somebody asked it to."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.17,Shot,,0,0,0,,S67  Silence after the last word
